The shared pieces of the AMIX Installer's kernels, in /usr/share/amix-installer:
kit-tools/ (patch_io_init.py and patch_int2.py with their stub templates: the
boot and level-2 interrupt chains of the linked drivers; check_relink_relocs.py,
the loader's relocation check; stamp-rootcard.py, the root and swap device;
kernel-nswap.py, the swap size) and kernel-040/ (amix-kernel-040 and the
port's relink chain, which make our 68040/060 kernel from your own stock AMIX
2.1c kernel; it uses NetBSD 10.1's syssrc.tgz, which the installer fetches once).
No AMIX kernel is included.
